OL,3,GNEWSAFire on 17th floor of tower block
OL,4,Aunder control
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation is under way into the
OL,7,Fcause of a fire at a flat on the 17th
OL,8,Ffloor of a 22-storey tower block in
OL,9,Feast London.
OL,11,FTen fire engines and around 70
OL,12,Ffirefighters were called to Blackwall
OL,13,FWay in Poplar at around 04:30 BST. Half
OL,14,Fof the two-room flat and balcony was
OL,15,Fdamaged in the blaze.
OL,17,FA woman and one child left the
OL,18,Fresidence before firefighters arrived
OL,19,Fand a further 50 people left the
OL,20,Fbuilding before the brigade arrived on
OL,21,Fscene and are currently at a rest
OL,22,Fcentre.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
